<h2>Core Concepts and Architecture Patterns</h2>
<p>This lesson covers critical architectural patterns and concepts that form the foundation of enterprise-grade AI systems. Understanding these patterns enables you to design systems that scale reliably, perform efficiently, and maintain operational excellence in production environments.</p>

